{
  "format": "rog5-production-module-selection-v1",
  "description": "The modules of the production ramdisk tree: kernel-build modules (install paths under kernel/) and the ROG5 external modules built against the same objects. Selected on 2026-09-21 (module-selection-r1) for power, USB, UFS, display, GPU and Wi-Fi. uinput (drivers/input/misc) added 2026-09-24 for the bench virtual touchscreen. Bluetooth (QCA6490 on uart18: bluetooth, hci_uart, btqca, btbcm, hidp; ecdh_generic, ecc, kpp) added 2026-09-24. Bluetooth profiles (uhid, rfcomm, bnep) added 2026-09-24. CPU bandwidth monitors (icc-bwmon) and RPMh sleep stats (qcom_stats) added 2026-09-24. rog5-input-boost (LLCC/DDR boost while the user interacts) added 2026-09-24. rog5-gmu-bind (empty GMU driver so GCC/GPUCC reach sync_state) added 2026-09-24. Haptics (rog5-aw8697, uses ff-memless), light/proximity (rog5-vcnl36866) and the logo LED (rog5-aura + led-class-multicolor) added 2026-09-24. Audio (APR/q6 DSP services, SENARY MI2S sound card, CS35L45 amplifiers, LPASS LPI pinctrl and their ALSA core dependencies, 34 modules) added 2026-09-24. Sensor DSP support (fastrpc for the SLPI sensor registry listener, socinfo for /sys/devices/soc0) added 2026-09-26. USB host networking for docks (mii, usbnet, cdc_ether, cdc_ncm, r8152, r8153_ecm, ax88179_178a) added 2026-09-26. DisplayPort alt mode on the side port (phy-qcom-qmp-combo, gpio-sbu-mux, pmic_glink_altmode, aux-bridge, aux-hpd-bridge) and server USB drivers (rndis_host, aqc111, usbserial, pl2303, ch341, cdc-acm, xpad) added 2026-09-27. Rear camera flash / torch (leds-qcom-flash, led-class-flash) added 2026-09-28. Board thermistors (qcom-spmi-adc5, qcom-vadc-common, qcom-spmi-adc-tm5) for the skin thermal policy added 2026-09-28. Microphones (VA macro: snd-soc-lpass-va-macro, snd-soc-lpass-macro-common) added 2026-09-28. Bottom USB-C port stage B (tcpm, tcpci, tcpci_rt1711h for the RT1715 Type-C controller on i2c13) added 2026-09-30. Hardware video decode/encode (videocc-sm8350, qcom-iris and its V4L2 mem2mem/videobuf2 dependencies: videodev, v4l2-mem2mem, videobuf2-common/-v4l2/-memops/-dma-contig) added 2026-10-01 (kernel k114).",
